<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9139"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lostdog<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lostdog<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 25, 2005 - 11:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Chat r oo m way o ff ? <BR> <BR>Oh yeah? How about Lilymarie on 2/13 BTK Theories/ BTK Occupations <BR> <BR>Maybe he works at the animal shelter as a hobby? Just for fun....he likes to work on the days that time has expired and it&#39;s time to be &#34;put down&#34;.  <BR> <BR>Lilly, I&#39;ll bet he sh&#42;t when he read that! As the friendly neighborhood dog catcher he could &#34;watch without being watched&#34;. Meanwhile back at the shelter he could facilitate and observe death daily. <BR> <BR>Any other close calls out there? Let the irony begin!    <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9139-->
<!--Post: 9189--><!--Time: 1109415238-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9189"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lostdog<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lostdog<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 2:53 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->In the final minutes of December 20th...&#40;General BTK Discussion&#41; <BR> <BR>Q wanted to know what was north of Ketchi. <BR> <BR>Now we all know.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9189-->
<!--Post: 9190--><!--Time: 1109415566-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9190"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lostdog<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lostdog<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 2:59 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Be sure to reread Steve_huff&#39;s description of BTK in the Profile thread from 12/06. <BR> <BR>Boy, that huff really creeps me out! <BR>                - Denny the Dog Catcher<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9190-->
<!--Post: 9195--><!--Time: 1109422928-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9195"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 5:02 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Please continue with your Haldol. Give it more time, it obviously hasn&#39;t kicked in yet. This obsession you have for keeping records of words from months ago only underscores your psychosis.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9195-->
<!--Post: 9198--><!--Time: 1109424368-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9198"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:rwmm@swbell.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilymarie<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 5:26 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Lostdog - I had forgotten all about that until this morning! In all fairness - that was a sarcastic comment on my part in response to some folks that I thought had gone too far. But thanks for the reminder! <BR> <BR>George...there is probably stuff I don&#39;t know about between you and Lostdog...but that was more like a comment I would make - and regret later. When I read this thread - I don&#39;t think that was deserved &#40;based on this thread&#41;.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9198-->
<!--Post: 9234--><!--Time: 1109440673-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9234"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 9:57 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Lily, three knee-jerk reactions from me but he ridiculed people I respect and attacked me personally. No apologies. We all go way overboard once in a while.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9234-->
<!--Post: 9292--><!--Time: 1109463876-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9292"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Pax56<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Pax56<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 4:24 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->People - this is a wonderful opportunity for us to see what worked and what didn&#39;t.  What we learn here could really help all us web sleuths in our next endeavors.  For instance, I seriously debated this guy as having Moriarty-level intelligence.  Does he have more than it appears on the outside?   Let&#39;s find out!  This is amazingly fascinating.  The data&#39;s going to come in fast and furious now, so let&#39;s get ready and learn.  I was WAY OFF in so many ways, but I was on the money with a few - I actually nailed his age &#40;end of WWII&#41;.  And even our misses uncovered some great stuff.  So please - go ahead and dig up the old posts - take mine for starters if you must - just be kindly about it.  I am just SO PSYCHED that he was caught!  YAHOO!!!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9292-->
<!--Post: 9299--><!--Time: 1109465413-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9299"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:rwmm@swbell.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilymarie<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 4:50 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Me too, PAX56!! Psyched, relieved and ready to celebrate!! I sort of had a sense of &#34;let down&#34; after it sunk in thinking I would lose my catch BTK friends - but you&#39;re right - there&#39;s going to be a lot of fun now that we have the advantage of &#34;hindsight&#34;!! <BR> <BR>There were a lot of folks that had him pin&#39;d on some of the important elements. For example - those that said he was religious - I totally didn&#39;t believe that! <BR> <BR>Thanks for your nice post.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9299-->
<!--Post: 9303--><!--Time: 1109466061-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9303"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Iq<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Iq<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 5:01 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Pax- You touched on something I&#39;ve been thinking about. Do you guys think the information will really come flooding in?  <BR>That was my first thought as well, but I really doubt it now. <BR> <BR>The DA&#39;s office is going to take no chances of screwing up this prosecution. After what happend with the O.J. case  <BR>I think they will err on the side of caution in every way. I wouldn&#39;t blame them one bit for keeping tight lipped  <BR>until he is found guilty on every single count and sentenced. <BR> <BR>If I&#39;m right the discussions will be on a different level but still contain the same amount of speculation and theory  <BR>that we have all grown to love. I look forward to our continued discussions and the new threads that develop from  <BR>the next phase of the case. <BR> <BR>Tom - Have you secured a new domain? My suggestions: <BR> <BR>lynchbtk.com <BR>frybtk.com <BR>lockhispunkassupandthrowawaythekey.com <BR> <BR>iq <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9303-->
<!--Post: 9311--><!--Time: 1109468029-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9311"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Pax56<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Pax56<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 5:33 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I&#39;m lovin&#39; it, iq! &#40;lmao, with apologies to McDonald&#39;s&#41; <BR> <BR>You&#39;re absolutely right, LE will be stingy with info, but now the major media&#39;s on it, and they have a suspect, so they will undoubtedly do a lot of digging for us. <BR> <BR>I go with l&#42;key.com - old sparky would be the easy way out, and a lynchin&#39; would be wrong, not because of the injustice, but because he could claim victimhood.  That ol&#39; boy has some serious facin&#39;-up time to do, and he best be started.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9311-->
<!--Post: 9330--><!--Time: 1109478592-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9330"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 8:29 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->And that was an impressive DA. Of the folks I saw on CNN, the DA seemed the most charismatic and sincere -- no empty words.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9330-->
